
Requirement  -> design image download api like Glide, Coil

 Glide ->
 Glide.load(
 url = "imageUrl"
 imageView = "ImageView"
 palaceHolder = "placeHolder")



Approach ->

Level 1 ->
1. Download image from URL
2. Return cached image if available
3. Store image in Memory Cache (RAM)
4. Store image in Disk Cache (Internal Storage)


Level 2 ->
5. Deduplicate concurrent requests for the same URL
6. Support cancellation
7. Control memory usage and prevent OOM
8. Be lifecycle-aware



Imp:
Memory Cache → Bitmap
Disk Cache → Image bytes/file




